{"body":"`oidc_default_role` / `otp_default_role` are typed `str` here while `Settings` constrains them to `Literal["member", "viewer"]`, so the published OpenAPI (and the generated client) say "any string" and `WorkspaceConfigPanels.tsx` indexes `ROLE_LABELS[config.oidc_default_role]` — any other value renders an empty cell with no error. Type them `Literal["member", "viewer"]` so the contract matches the setting (rule 45: the OpenAPI document is the interface).

